+  A clone's copy of the instance carries its spawner as the original left it: its timer, the firings of its wave and the firings it has left. The duplication fired on the visit after the hit is spent on the copy, so a clone of an evolved Skeleton carrying it makes nothing; an instance listed by a hit and not yet visited fires on the clone too, whose child is a clone. On 16.635 data the row is NotCloned, so the copy is taken off as the clone is made.
